abstract: >-
  MobiOrigin is a CPU-oriented sequence-and-marker classifier that assigns
  bacterial DNA fragments to plasmid, chromosome, phage, or an explicit
  unclassified state. Version 0.1.7 retains the frozen three-seed dev1 model
  while making inference invariant to FASTA strand orientation. Records with
  non-ACGT symbols fail closed as unclassified with an explicit reason rather
  than receiving a potentially unstable biological-origin label.
